# Allowlist: the image only needs the lockfile, the project metadata and the
# package. Everything else (.git, .venv, .worktrees, data/, exports, tests/,
# docs/, .env and other secrets, caches) stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!virtubooth/

# never ship caches or local runtime data that ended up inside the package
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.env
**/*.env
